  "markscheme": {
    "html": "<section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"3a\"><p><strong>3a</strong></p><p></p>\n<p>A travelling wave moves along the string and is reflected at the fixed end.</p>\n<p>The incident and the reflected waves superpose and form a standing wave.</p>\n<p></p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"3b\"><p><strong>3b</strong></p><p></p>\n<p>\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_03\"><img alt=\"Source markscheme diagram 3\" src=\"asset:fig_03\"/></figure>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>Any of these positions can be labelled, anywhere along the vertical line where the antinode is formed.</p>\n<p></p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"3c\"><p><strong>3c</strong></p><p></p>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\lambda = \\frac{3.7}{2.5} = 1.48\"></span> m</p>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"c = (35)(1.48) \\approx 52\"></span> m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></p>\n<p>Final answer must be given to 2 significant figures.</p>\n<p></p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"3d\"><p><strong>3d</strong></p><p> </p>\n<p>\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_04\"><img alt=\"Source markscheme diagram 4\" src=\"asset:fig_04\"/></figure>\n</p>\n<p> </p></section>"
  },
  "paper": "paper_2",
  "question": {
    "html": "<p>One end of a string is fixed to a wall. The other end of the string is oscillated vertically with a frequency of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"35.0\"></span> Hz so that a standing wave is formed on the string. </p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>a. Outline how a standing wave is formed on the string.</p>\n<p>   [2]</p>\n<p>b. Label the position of an antinode with the letter A on the diagram.</p>\n<p>    [1]</p>\n<p>c. Calculate the speed of the wave on the string. Give your answer to an appropriate number of significant figures.</p>\n<p>    [2]</p>\n<p>The frequency of the oscillations is reduced to <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"14.0\"></span> Hz.</p>\n<p>d. Draw how the new standing wave looks like on the string.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_02\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 2\" src=\"asset:fig_02\"/></figure>\n\n<p>  [2]</p>"
  },
